      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAYSEA'S MAX (2) goes very well this trip starting 15 times for 12 wins and two minors. In the money last time at Capalaba (19.66) in a OPEN, finishing a 1.5 lengths third. Looks a key chance on best form. CAMBLA DIVA (8) goes very well at the course and distance with five wins and a placing from seven starts. Placed last time (19.59) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing second and beaten a nose. Suited here and expected to run well. MASSARO (5) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (19.72) at Capalaba over 366m. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from three starts. Can do much better this time. SPRING GRIM (1) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (22.08) in a Grade 3/4 over 390m at this track.",
